{
  "dataList": [
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_1",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>慾求吧，並將慾望所求的一切吸食殆盡。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>披覆吧，而後毫不吝惜地吞食殆盡。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>渴望吧，並毫不遲疑地耗盡欲求的一切。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_4",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>慾求吧。如此一來，終將披覆。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_1",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>雖能填滿卻不予填滿。雖能享受卻就此止步。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>令其不滿溢而出，並依循秩序而行。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>切勿違逆規律。薛西弗斯銘記汝等所忍受的一切苦痛。</color>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
